---
---

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="container" data-reveal>
    <div class="section-label">À propos</div>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-photo">
        <img
          src="/images/profile.jpg"
          alt="Photo de Loïc Cupif"
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="about-text">
        <h2 class="about-title">Du pipeline au modèle<span>.</span></h2>

        <p>
          Étudiant en 5ème année Data Engineering & Machine Learning à l'EFREI Paris.
          J'ai effectué un échange académique à Concordia (Montréal) où j'ai approfondi
          le machine learning appliqué.
        </p>
        <p>
          Je recherche actuellement un stage de fin d'études en tant que Data Engineer.
          En dehors du code, je suis passionné de handball et de Formule 1.
        </p>

        <div class="about-cards">
          <div class="info-card">
            <div class="info-card-label">Nom</div>
            <div class="info-card-value">Loïc Cupif</div>
          </div>
          <div class="info-card">
            <div class="info-card-label">Email</div>
            <div class="info-card-value">loiccupif@gmail.com</div>
          </div>
          <div class="info-card">
            <div class="info-card-label">Localisation</div>
            <div class="info-card-value">Paris, France</div>
          </div>
          <div class="info-card">
            <div class="info-card-label">Focus</div>
            <div class="info-card-value">Data Eng · ML</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="/CV.pdf" download="CV_Loic_Cupif.pdf" class="btn-cv">
          ↓ Télécharger mon CV
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 86px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
    gap: 54px;
    margin-top: 30px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-photo {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
    display: block;
  }

  .about-title {
    font: 700 clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px) / 1.08 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .about-title span {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .about-text p {
    font: 400 17px / 1.7 'Manrope', sans-serif;
    color: #bcbcc4;
    margin: 22px 0 0;
  }

  .about-text p + p {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .about-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  .info-card {
    padding: 16px 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .info-card-label {
    font: 600 11px 'Manrope', sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .info-card-value {
    font: 600 16px 'Manrope', sans-serif;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-top: 5px;
  }

  .btn-cv {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    margin-top: 26px;
    font: 700 15px 'Manrope', sans-serif;
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 13px 22px;
    border-radius: 13px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-cv:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .about-photo {
      aspect-ratio: 16/9;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .about-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
